    - rid: 7118658877087023112
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: UnityEditor.GraphToolkitModule}
      data:
        m_Value: 'My Dearest Aditya,  I wish I were penning this missive to you under
          better means. Forgive my haste in foregoing the usual pleasantries, but
          I must I request your attendance immediately. I fear I cannot navigate
          this burgeoning predicament unaided.  Fare thee better than I fare.  You''re
          very loving friend,  Dr. Mitzli Arzu '
